---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: ToolsBuilt Design System - Style Guide & Tokens
description: Living style guide, design tokens, and accessible component library for ToolsBuilt.
noindex: true
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
---

{% import "partials/icon.njk" as icons %}

<main id="main-content" class="container py-8">
  <!-- Design System Header -->
  <header class="section-sm">
    <div class="cluster cluster-between mb-4">
      <div class="cluster">
        <span class="badge badge-primary">Design System v1.0</span>
        <span class="badge badge-date">Living Style Guide</span>
        <span class="badge badge-success">WCAG AA Compliant</span>
      </div>
      <div class="cluster">
        <button id="ds-theme-toggle" class="btn btn-secondary btn-sm" aria-label="Toggle Preview Theme">
          Toggle Theme
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>
    <h1 class="mb-2">ToolsBuilt Design System</h1>
    <p class="text-lg text-secondary">
      A fast, accessible, polished design system built with CSS custom properties, fluid typography, and zero-framework components. Crafted with a premium utility-product feel inspired by Linear, Vercel, and Raycast.
    </p>
  </header>

  <hr class="divider">

  <!-- =====================================================================
       1. COLOR SYSTEM & CONTRAST
       ===================================================================== -->
  <section id="colors" class="section-sm">
    <div class="mb-4">
      <h2>1. Color System</h2>
      <p class="text-secondary">
        Theme-aware scales for neutrals, brand iris-accent, semantic states, and 6 category identifiers. All foreground/background pairings exceed WCAG 2.1 AA requirements (4.5:1 for body text, 3:1 for UI borders).
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Neutral Scale -->
    <h3 class="mb-3 text-base font-semibold">Neutral Scale (12 Steps)</h3>
    <div class="grid-auto-fit mb-6" style="--grid-min-item: 160px;">
      <div class="card p-3 stack stack-xs">
        <div style="height: 48px; background: var(--neutral-1); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-radius: var(--radius-md);"></div>
        <span class="font-mono text-xs font-semibold">--neutral-1</span>
        <span class="text-xs text-tertiary">Canvas Base</span>
      </div>
      <div class="card p-3 stack stack-xs">
        <div style="height: 48px; background: var(--neutral-2); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-radius: var(--radius-md);"></div>
        <span class="font-mono text-xs font-semibold">--neutral-2</span>
        <span class="text-xs text-tertiary">Surface Canvas</span>
      </div>
      <div class="card p-3 stack stack-xs">
        <div style="height: 48px; background: var(--neutral-3); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-radius: var(--radius-md);"></div>
        <span class="font-mono text-xs font-semibold">--neutral-3</span>
        <span class="text-xs text-tertiary">Card / Muted</span>
      </div>
      <div class="card p-3 stack stack-xs">
        <div style="height: 48px; background: var(--neutral-4); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-radius: var(--radius-md);"></div>
        <span class="font-mono text-xs font-semibold">--neutral-4</span>
        <span class="text-xs text-tertiary">Border Subtle</span>
      </div>
      <div class="card p-3 stack stack-xs">
        <div style="height: 48px; background: var(--neutral-5); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-radius: var(--radius-md);"></div>
        <span class="font-mono text-xs font-semibold">--neutral-5</span>
        <span class="text-xs text-tertiary">Border Hover</span>
      </div>
      <div class="card p-3 stack stack-xs">
        <div style="height: 48px; background: var(--neutral-6); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-radius: var(--radius-md);"></div>
        <span class="font-mono text-xs font-semibold">--neutral-6</span>
        <span class="text-xs text-tertiary">Placeholder / Icon</span>
      </div>
      <div class="card p-3 stack stack-xs">
        <div style="height: 48px; background: var(--neutral-7); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-radius: var(--radius-md);"></div>
        <span class="font-mono text-xs font-semibold">--neutral-7</span>
        <span class="text-xs text-tertiary">Border Strong (&gt;3:1)</span>
      </div>
      <div class="card p-3 stack stack-xs">
        <div style="height: 48px; background: var(--neutral-8); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-radius: var(--radius-md);"></div>
        <span class="font-mono text-xs font-semibold">--neutral-8</span>
        <span class="text-xs text-tertiary">Text Secondary</span>
      </div>
      <div class="card p-3 stack stack-xs">
        <div style="height: 48px; background: var(--neutral-9); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-radius: var(--radius-md);"></div>
        <span class="font-mono text-xs font-semibold">--neutral-9</span>
        <span class="text-xs text-tertiary">Text Subtitle</span>
      </div>
      <div class="card p-3 stack stack-xs">
        <div style="height: 48px; background: var(--neutral-10); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-radius: var(--radius-md);"></div>
        <span class="font-mono text-xs font-semibold">--neutral-10</span>
        <span class="text-xs text-tertiary">Text Strong</span>
      </div>
      <div class="card p-3 stack stack-xs">
        <div style="height: 48px; background: var(--neutral-11); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-radius: var(--radius-md);"></div>
        <span class="font-mono text-xs font-semibold">--neutral-11</span>
        <span class="text-xs text-tertiary">Text Primary</span>
      </div>
      <div class="card p-3 stack stack-xs">
        <div style="height: 48px; background: var(--neutral-12); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-radius: var(--radius-md);"></div>
        <span class="font-mono text-xs font-semibold">--neutral-12</span>
        <span class="text-xs text-tertiary">Contrast Extreme</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Accent Scale -->
    <h3 class="mb-3 text-base font-semibold">Brand Iris-Accent Scale (12 Steps)</h3>
    <div class="grid-auto-fit mb-6" style="--grid-min-item: 160px;">
      <div class="card p-3 stack stack-xs">
        <div style="height: 48px; background: var(--accent-1); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-radius: var(--radius-md);"></div>
        <span class="font-mono text-xs font-semibold">--accent-1</span>
        <span class="text-xs text-tertiary">Light Tint</span>
      </div>
      <div class="card p-3 stack stack-xs">
        <div style="height: 48px; background: var(--accent-2); border-radius: var(--radius-md);"></div>
        <span class="font-mono text-xs font-semibold">--accent-2</span>
        <span class="text-xs text-tertiary">Subtle Wash</span>
      </div>
      <div class="card p-3 stack stack-xs">
        <div style="height: 48px; background: var(--accent-3); border-radius: var(--radius-md);"></div>
        <span class="font-mono text-xs font-semibold">--accent-3</span>
        <span class="text-xs text-tertiary">Subtle Bg</span>
      </div>
      <div class="card p-3 stack stack-xs">
        <div style="height: 48px; background: var(--accent-5); border-radius: var(--radius-md);"></div>
        <span class="font-mono text-xs font-semibold">--accent-5</span>
        <span class="text-xs text-tertiary">Light Border</span>
      </div>
      <div class="card p-3 stack stack-xs">
        <div style="height: 48px; background: var(--accent-7); border-radius: var(--radius-md);"></div>
        <span class="font-mono text-xs font-semibold">--accent-7</span>
        <span class="text-xs text-tertiary">Vibrant Iris</span>
      </div>
      <div class="card p-3 stack stack-xs">
        <div style="height: 48px; background: var(--accent-8); border-radius: var(--radius-md);"></div>
        <span class="font-mono text-xs font-semibold">--accent-8</span>
        <span class="text-xs text-tertiary">Brand Primary</span>
      </div>
      <div class="card p-3 stack stack-xs">
        <div style="height: 48px; background: var(--accent-9); border-radius: var(--radius-md);"></div>
        <span class="font-mono text-xs font-semibold">--accent-9</span>
        <span class="text-xs text-tertiary">Accent Hover</span>
      </div>
      <div class="card p-3 stack stack-xs">
        <div style="height: 48px; background: var(--accent-11); border-radius: var(--radius-md);"></div>
        <span class="font-mono text-xs font-semibold">--accent-11</span>
        <span class="text-xs text-tertiary">Deep Indigo</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Semantic & Category Accents -->
    <h3 class="mb-3 text-base font-semibold">Semantic States & Categories</h3>
    <div class="grid-3 mb-6">
      <div class="card p-4" style="background: var(--color-success-bg); border-color: var(--color-success-border); color: var(--color-success-text);">
        <div class="cluster mb-1">
          <span class="font-bold">Success</span>
          <span class="badge badge-success">7.29:1</span>
        </div>
        <span class="text-xs">Confirmation, positive metrics, valid input</span>
      </div>
      <div class="card p-4" style="background: var(--color-warning-bg); border-color: var(--color-warning-border); color: var(--color-warning-text);">
        <div class="cluster mb-1">
          <span class="font-bold">Warning</span>
          <span class="badge badge-warning">6.84:1</span>
        </div>
        <span class="text-xs">Cautions, non-blocking guidance, limits</span>
      </div>
      <div class="card p-4" style="background: var(--color-danger-bg); border-color: var(--color-danger-border); color: var(--color-danger-text);">
        <div class="cluster mb-1">
          <span class="font-bold">Danger</span>
          <span class="badge badge-danger">7.30:1</span>
        </div>
        <span class="text-xs">Errors, invalid entries, destructive actions</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="grid-auto-fit mb-6" style="--grid-min-item: 180px;">
      <div class="card p-3" style="background: var(--cat-date-bg); border-color: var(--cat-date-border); color: var(--cat-date-color);">
        <span class="text-xs font-bold">Date & Time</span>
        <div class="text-xs mt-1">Age, Days, Date Calc</div>
      </div>
      <div class="card p-3" style="background: var(--cat-math-bg); border-color: var(--cat-math-border); color: var(--cat-math-color);">
        <span class="text-xs font-bold">Math & Finance</span>
        <div class="text-xs mt-1">Discount, % Change</div>
      </div>
      <div class="card p-3" style="background: var(--cat-text-bg); border-color: var(--cat-text-border); color: var(--cat-text-color);">
        <span class="text-xs font-bold">Text & Writing</span>
        <div class="text-xs mt-1">Word Counter, Case</div>
      </div>
      <div class="card p-3" style="background: var(--cat-security-bg); border-color: var(--cat-security-border); color: var(--cat-security-color);">
        <span class="text-xs font-bold">Security & Dev</span>
        <div class="text-xs mt-1">Password Generator</div>
      </div>
      <div class="card p-3" style="background: var(--cat-fun-bg); border-color: var(--cat-fun-border); color: var(--cat-fun-color);">
        <span class="text-xs font-bold">Fun & Chance</span>
        <div class="text-xs mt-1">Random Picker</div>
      </div>
      <div class="card p-3" style="background: var(--cat-dev-bg); border-color: var(--cat-dev-border); color: var(--cat-dev-color);">
        <span class="text-xs font-bold">Developer / Utilities</span>
        <div class="text-xs mt-1">Future Categories</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <hr class="divider">

  <!-- =====================================================================
       2. TYPOGRAPHY & FLUID TYPE SCALE
       ===================================================================== -->
  <section id="typography" class="section-sm">
    <div class="mb-4">
      <h2>2. Typography System</h2>
      <p class="text-secondary">
        Self-hosted Inter Variable font (latin subset, woff2) with Arial size-adjust fallback to eliminate layout shift (CLS). Fluid type scale governed by CSS <code>clamp()</code> across 12 distinct steps.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="card p-6 mb-6 stack stack-md">
      <div class="cluster cluster-between" style="border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); padding-bottom: var(--space-3);">
        <div>
          <span class="font-mono text-xs text-tertiary">--font-size-5xl / clamp(2.375rem, 1.85rem + 2.6vw, 3.5rem)</span>
          <div style="font-size: var(--font-size-5xl); font-weight: var(--font-weight-bold); line-height: var(--line-height-tight);">
            ToolsBuilt Display 5XL
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="cluster cluster-between" style="border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); padding-bottom: var(--space-3);">
        <div>
          <span class="font-mono text-xs text-tertiary">--font-size-4xl / clamp(2rem, 1.66rem + 1.7vw, 2.75rem)</span>
          <div style="font-size: var(--font-size-4xl); font-weight: var(--font-weight-bold);">
            Hero Heading 4XL
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="cluster cluster-between" style="border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); padding-bottom: var(--space-3);">
        <div>
          <span class="font-mono text-xs text-tertiary">--font-size-3xl / clamp(1.75rem, 1.51rem + 1.2vw, 2.25rem)</span>
          <div style="font-size: var(--font-size-3xl); font-weight: var(--font-weight-bold);">
            Primary Result &amp; Section Title 3XL
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="cluster cluster-between" style="border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); padding-bottom: var(--space-3);">
        <div>
          <span class="font-mono text-xs text-tertiary">--font-size-2xl / clamp(1.5rem, 1.35rem + 0.75vw, 1.875rem)</span>
          <div style="font-size: var(--font-size-2xl); font-weight: var(--font-weight-semibold);">
            Subsection Heading 2XL
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="cluster cluster-between" style="border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); padding-bottom: var(--space-3);">
        <div>
          <span class="font-mono text-xs text-tertiary">--font-size-xl / clamp(1.3125rem, 1.21rem + 0.52vw, 1.5rem)</span>
          <div style="font-size: var(--font-size-xl); font-weight: var(--font-weight-semibold);">
            Card Title / High-priority Heading XL
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="cluster cluster-between" style="border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); padding-bottom: var(--space-3);">
        <div>
          <span class="font-mono text-xs text-tertiary">--font-size-base / clamp(0.9375rem, 0.9rem + 0.19vw, 1rem)</span>
          <div style="font-size: var(--font-size-base);">
            Standard body copy and input field typography. Clean, modern, high legibility.
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="cluster cluster-between">
        <div>
          <span class="font-mono text-xs text-tertiary">--font-size-xs &amp; tabular-nums</span>
          <div class="font-mono text-xs tabular-nums text-secondary">
            [RESULT]: 1,234,567.89 | 9,876,543.21 | 0.00000000 (Monospace &amp; Tabular alignment)
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <hr class="divider">

  <!-- =====================================================================
       3. SPACING, SHADOWS, & RADIUS
       ===================================================================== -->
  <section id="scales" class="section-sm">
    <div class="mb-4">
      <h2>3. Spatial, Shadow &amp; Radius Scales</h2>
      <p class="text-secondary">
        4px mathematical base scale for rhythm, soft layered elevation shadows, and progressive radius tokens.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Shadows Showcase -->
    <h3 class="mb-3 text-base font-semibold">Elevation &amp; Shadows</h3>
    <div class="grid-auto-fit mb-6" style="--grid-min-item: 160px;">
      <div class="card p-4 text-center" style="box-shadow: var(--shadow-xs);">
        <span class="text-xs font-mono">--shadow-xs</span>
      </div>
      <div class="card p-4 text-center" style="box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);">
        <span class="text-xs font-mono">--shadow-sm</span>
      </div>
      <div class="card p-4 text-center" style="box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);">
        <span class="text-xs font-mono">--shadow-md</span>
      </div>
      <div class="card p-4 text-center" style="box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg);">
        <span class="text-xs font-mono">--shadow-lg</span>
      </div>
      <div class="card p-4 text-center" style="box-shadow: var(--shadow-xl);">
        <span class="text-xs font-mono">--shadow-xl</span>
      </div>
      <div class="card p-4 text-center" style="box-shadow: var(--shadow-glow);">
        <span class="text-xs font-mono">--shadow-glow</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Radius Showcase -->
    <h3 class="mb-3 text-base font-semibold">Radius Scale</h3>
    <div class="grid-auto-fit mb-6" style="--grid-min-item: 140px;">
      <div class="p-3 text-center" style="border: 2px solid var(--accent-primary); border-radius: var(--radius-xs);">
        <span class="text-xs font-mono">xs (4px)</span>
      </div>
      <div class="p-3 text-center" style="border: 2px solid var(--accent-primary); border-radius: var(--radius-sm);">
        <span class="text-xs font-mono">sm (6px)</span>
      </div>
      <div class="p-3 text-center" style="border: 2px solid var(--accent-primary); border-radius: var(--radius-md);">
        <span class="text-xs font-mono">md (8px)</span>
      </div>
      <div class="p-3 text-center" style="border: 2px solid var(--accent-primary); border-radius: var(--radius-lg);">
        <span class="text-xs font-mono">lg (12px)</span>
      </div>
      <div class="p-3 text-center" style="border: 2px solid var(--accent-primary); border-radius: var(--radius-xl);">
        <span class="text-xs font-mono">xl (16px)</span>
      </div>
      <div class="p-3 text-center" style="border: 2px solid var(--accent-primary); border-radius: var(--radius-full);">
        <span class="text-xs font-mono">full (9999px)</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <hr class="divider">

  <!-- =====================================================================
       4. BUTTONS & CONTROLS
       ===================================================================== -->
  <section id="buttons" class="section-sm">
    <div class="mb-4">
      <h2>4. Buttons &amp; Interactive Controls</h2>
      <p class="text-secondary">
        All interactive buttons meet the minimum 44px mobile touch target requirement, with crisp active and focus states.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="card p-6 mb-6 stack stack-md">
      <div>
        <h4 class="text-sm font-semibold mb-3">Variants</h4>
        <div class="cluster">
          <button class="btn btn-primary">{{ icons.icon("sparkles", "", 18) }} Primary Button</button>
          <button class="btn btn-secondary">{{ icons.icon("refresh", "", 18) }} Secondary Button</button>
          <button class="btn btn-ghost">{{ icons.icon("settings", "", 18) }} Ghost Button</button>
          <button class="btn btn-danger">{{ icons.icon("trash", "", 18) }} Danger Button</button>
          <button class="btn btn-secondary btn-icon-only" aria-label="Copy action">{{ icons.icon("copy", "", 18) }}</button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h4 class="text-sm font-semibold mb-3">Sizes</h4>
        <div class="cluster">
          <button class="btn btn-primary btn-sm">Small (36px)</button>
          <button class="btn btn-primary btn-md">Medium (44px)</button>
          <button class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">Large (48px)</button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h4 class="text-sm font-semibold mb-3">States (Loading &amp; Disabled)</h4>
        <div class="cluster">
          <button class="btn btn-primary btn-loading">Processing...</button>
          <button class="btn btn-primary" disabled>Disabled Primary</button>
          <button class="btn btn-secondary" disabled>Disabled Secondary</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <hr class="divider">

  <!-- =====================================================================
       5. FORM CONTROLS & INPUT GROUPS
       ===================================================================== -->
  <section id="forms" class="section-sm">
    <div class="mb-4">
      <h2>5. Form Controls &amp; Input Architecture</h2>
      <p class="text-secondary">
        Inputs with accessible label associations, unit prefix/suffix add-ons, helper texts, and <code>:user-invalid</code> error styling.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="card p-6 mb-6">
      <div class="grid-2">
        <!-- Text Input with Prefix -->
        <div class="form-group">
          <label for="ds-price-input" class="form-label">Price with Currency Prefix</label>
          <div class="input-group">
            <span class="input-prefix">$</span>
            <input id="ds-price-input" type="number" class="form-input" placeholder="99.00" value="120.00">
          </div>
          <span class="form-hint">Enter amount before discounts</span>
        </div>

        <!-- Number Input with Suffix -->
        <div class="form-group">
          <label for="ds-tax-input" class="form-label">Tax Rate Suffix</label>
          <div class="input-group">
            <input id="ds-tax-input" type="number" class="form-input" placeholder="8.5" value="7.5">
            <span class="input-suffix">%</span>
          </div>
          <span class="form-hint">Local sales tax percentage</span>
        </div>

        <!-- Date Input -->
        <div class="form-group">
          <label for="ds-date-input" class="form-label">Date Selection</label>
          <input id="ds-date-input" type="date" class="form-input" value="2026-10-15">
          <span class="form-hint">ISO date selection standard</span>
        </div>

        <!-- Select Dropdown -->
        <div class="form-group">
          <label for="ds-select-input" class="form-label">Unit Category</label>
          <select id="ds-select-input" class="form-select">
            <option>Days &amp; Calendar Time</option>
            <option>Percentages &amp; Discounts</option>
            <option>Text &amp; Characters</option>
          </select>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Switches and Checkboxes -->
      <div class="cluster cluster-between mt-4 pt-4" style="border-top: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);">
        <label class="switch">
          <input type="checkbox" checked>
          <span class="switch-track"><span class="switch-thumb"></span></span>
          <span class="text-sm font-medium">Include leap years</span>
        </label>

        <label class="checkbox-label">
          <input type="checkbox" checked>
          <span>Require uppercase characters (A-Z)</span>
        </label>

        <label class="radio-label">
          <input type="radio" name="ds-radio" checked>
          <span>Stacked discount mode</span>
        </label>
      </div>

      <!-- Range Slider -->
      <div class="form-group mt-6">
        <div class="cluster cluster-between">
          <label for="ds-range-input" class="form-label mb-0">Password Length: <span id="ds-range-val" class="font-bold text-accent">16</span> characters</label>
        </div>
        <input id="ds-range-input" type="range" min="8" max="64" value="16" oninput="document.getElementById('ds-range-val').textContent = this.value">
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <hr class="divider">

  <!-- =====================================================================
       6. CALCULATOR RESULT PANEL (CORE UTILITY PRODUCT POLISH)
       ===================================================================== -->
  <section id="results" class="section-sm">
    <div class="mb-4">
      <h2>6. Calculator Result Panel</h2>
      <p class="text-secondary">
        High-visibility primary result display with tabular digit alignment, copy-to-clipboard integration, secondary metrics grid, and subtle "result updated" flash cue.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="result-box mb-6" id="demo-result-box">
      <div class="copy-btn-slot">
        <button id="demo-copy-btn" class="btn btn-copy btn-sm cluster cluster-sm" onclick="ToolsBuilt.copy('31 Days, 10 Hours', 'Result copied to clipboard!'); document.getElementById('demo-result-box').classList.remove('is-updated'); void document.getElementById('demo-result-box').offsetWidth; document.getElementById('demo-result-box').classList.add('is-updated');">
          {{ icons.icon("copy", "", 14) }} Copy Result
        </button>
      </div>
      <div class="result-title">Primary Calculation Result</div>
      <div class="result-value primary-result">31 Days, 10 Hours</div>

      <div class="result-secondary metrics-grid">
        <div class="result-metric">
          <span class="result-metric-label">Total Weeks</span>
          <span class="result-metric-val">4.48 wks</span>
        </div>
        <div class="result-metric">
          <span class="result-metric-label">Business Days</span>
          <span class="result-metric-val">22 days</span>
        </div>
        <div class="result-metric">
          <span class="result-metric-label">Total Hours</span>
          <span class="result-metric-val">754 hrs</span>
        </div>
        <div class="result-metric">
          <span class="result-metric-label">Completion %</span>
          <span class="result-metric-val">84.9%</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="cluster">
      <button class="btn btn-secondary btn-sm" onclick="document.getElementById('demo-result-box').classList.remove('is-updated'); void document.getElementById('demo-result-box').offsetWidth; document.getElementById('demo-result-box').classList.add('is-updated'); ToolsBuilt.toast('Triggered result updated pulse');">
        Test "Result Updated" Visual Cue
      </button>
    </div>
  </section>

  <hr class="divider">

  <!-- =====================================================================
       7. CARDS & TILES
       ===================================================================== -->
  <section id="cards" class="section-sm">
    <div class="mb-4">
      <h2>7. Cards &amp; Stat Tiles</h2>
      <p class="text-secondary">
        Precision hover lift with theme-aware glow borders and structured metadata.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid-3 mb-6">
      <!-- Tool Card Preview 1 -->
      <a href="#cards" class="tool-card" onclick="event.preventDefault(); ToolsBuilt.toast('Tool Card Clicked!');">
        <div class="tool-icon-wrapper" data-category="date-time">
          {{ icons.icon("calendar-clock", "", 24) }}
        </div>
        <div class="tool-info">
          <div class="cluster cluster-between mb-1">
            <h3 class="tool-title">Age Calculator</h3>
            <span class="badge badge-date">Date &amp; Time</span>
          </div>
          <p class="tool-desc">Calculate exact age in years, months, days, hours, and minutes with leap year accuracy.</p>
        </div>
      </a>

      <!-- Tool Card Preview 2 -->
      <a href="#cards" class="tool-card" onclick="event.preventDefault(); ToolsBuilt.toast('Tool Card Clicked!');">
        <div class="tool-icon-wrapper" data-category="math-finance">
          {{ icons.icon("percent", "", 24) }}
        </div>
        <div class="tool-info">
          <div class="cluster cluster-between mb-1">
            <h3 class="tool-title">Discount Calculator</h3>
            <span class="badge badge-math">Math &amp; Finance</span>
          </div>
          <p class="tool-desc">Compute final prices with single or stacked discounts and tax calculations in real time.</p>
        </div>
      </a>

      <!-- Stat Tile -->
      <div class="stat-tile">
        <span class="stat-label">Active Calculators</span>
        <span class="stat-value text-accent">10 Tools</span>
        <span class="text-xs text-secondary mt-1">100% Free, zero client tracking</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <hr class="divider">

  <!-- =====================================================================
       8. ACCORDIONS, TABLES, TOASTS, & ACCESSIBILITY WIDGETS
       ===================================================================== -->
  <section id="widgets" class="section-sm">
    <div class="mb-4">
      <h2>8. Semantic Accordion &amp; Components</h2>
      <p class="text-secondary">
        Accessible <code>&lt;details&gt;/&lt;summary&gt;</code> FAQ accordions, responsive tables, keyboard shortcut badges, and tooltips.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Accordion Showcase -->
    <div class="mb-6">
      <h3 class="text-base font-semibold mb-3">Modern &lt;details&gt; FAQ Accordion</h3>
      <details class="accordion">
        <summary class="accordion-summary">
          <span>How does the ToolsBuilt calculation engine work?</span>
          <span class="accordion-chevron">{{ icons.icon("chevron-down", "", 20) }}</span>
        </summary>
        <div class="accordion-content">
          All calculations execute strictly in your local browser using high-precision JavaScript arithmetic. Zero data is transmitted to external servers, guaranteeing complete privacy and sub-millisecond calculation speeds.
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="accordion">
        <summary class="accordion-summary">
          <span>Is the design system accessible for screen readers?</span>
          <span class="accordion-chevron">{{ icons.icon("chevron-down", "", 20) }}</span>
        </summary>
        <div class="accordion-content">
          Yes. The system strictly complies with WCAG 2.1 AA standards. Every interactive element has a minimum 44px touch target, focus-visible rings are rendered in both themes, contrast ratios exceed 4.5:1, and live regions notify assistive technology of updates.
        </div>
      </details>
    </div>

    <!-- Responsive Table -->
    <div class="mb-6">
      <h3 class="text-base font-semibold mb-3">Responsive Table Wrapper</h3>
      <div class="table-wrapper">
        <table class="table">
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th>Tool Name</th>
              <th>Category</th>
              <th>WCAG AA Ratio</th>
              <th>Status</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr>
              <td><strong>Age Calculator</strong></td>
              <td><span class="badge badge-date">Date &amp; Time</span></td>
              <td class="font-mono tabular-nums">17.85:1</td>
              <td><span class="badge badge-success">Production Ready</span></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td><strong>Discount Calculator</strong></td>
              <td><span class="badge badge-math">Math &amp; Finance</span></td>
              <td class="font-mono tabular-nums">15.71:1</td>
              <td><span class="badge badge-success">Production Ready</span></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td><strong>Password Generator</strong></td>
              <td><span class="badge badge-security">Security</span></td>
              <td class="font-mono tabular-nums">18.57:1</td>
              <td><span class="badge badge-success">Production Ready</span></td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Tooltip & Kbd hints -->
    <div class="cluster mb-6">
      <span class="text-sm">Keyboard Shortcut Hint:</span>
      <kbd>⌘</kbd> + <kbd>K</kbd> to search tools
      <span class="text-sm ml-4" data-tooltip="This is an accessible CSS-only tooltip!">Hover me for Tooltip</span>
    </div>

    <!-- Skeleton Loader -->
    <div class="mb-6 stack stack-sm">
      <h3 class="text-base font-semibold">Skeleton Loader Preview</h3>
      <div class="skeleton" style="height: 24px; width: 60%;"></div>
      <div class="skeleton" style="height: 18px; width: 90%;"></div>
      <div class="skeleton" style="height: 18px; width: 75%;"></div>
    </div>

    <!-- Empty State Component -->
    <div class="empty-state mb-6">
      <div class="empty-state-icon">
        {{ icons.icon("search", "", 48) }}
      </div>
      <div class="empty-state-title">No matching tools found</div>
      <div class="empty-state-desc">
        Try adjusting your search criteria or explore our categories from the navigation menu above.
      </div>
      <button class="btn btn-secondary btn-sm mt-2" onclick="ToolsBuilt.toast('Resetting filters...')">Reset Filters</button>
    </div>
  </section>

  <hr class="divider">

  <!-- =====================================================================
       9. ICON GALLERY (~40 24PX STROKE ICONS)
       ===================================================================== -->
  <section id="icons" class="section-sm">
    <div class="mb-4">
      <h2>9. Iconography (~40 Hand-authored Icons)</h2>
      <p class="text-secondary">
        Consistent 24x24 outline vector icons crafted with 2px stroke width, rounded caps, and stroke join. Zero external icon fonts or external runtime dependencies.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid-auto-fit" style="--grid-min-item: 110px;">
      {% set iconList = [
        "search", "menu", "close", "sun", "moon", "copy", "check", "share",
        "download", "upload", "calendar", "clock", "calculator", "percent",
        "text", "lock", "shield", "shuffle", "dice", "chevron", "chevron-down",
        "chevron-up", "chevron-left", "chevron-right", "arrow-right", "arrow-left",
        "external-link", "info", "warning", "trash", "refresh", "settings",
        "heart", "github", "eye", "eye-off", "plus", "minus", "filter",
        "sparkles", "code", "tag", "key", "cake", "wheel", "fun"
      ] %}
      {% for item in iconList %}
      <div class="card p-3 stack stack-xs items-center text-center">
        <div style="color: var(--accent-primary);">
          {{ icons.icon(item, "", 24) }}
        </div>
        <span class="font-mono text-2xs truncate w-full">{{ item }}</span>
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </section>
</main>

<script src="/assets/js/ui.js"></script>
<script>
  // Local Theme Toggle specifically for the Design System showcase
  document.getElementById('ds-theme-toggle')?.addEventListener('click', function() {
    const current = document.documentElement.getAttribute('data-theme') || 'light';
    const next = current === 'dark' ? 'light' : 'dark';
    document.documentElement.setAttribute('data-theme', next);
    localStorage.setItem('theme', next);
    ToolsBuilt.toast('Switched theme to ' + next);
  });
</script>
